    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Madness Trap Trek, a game with 8 progressively challenging stages filled with traps and puzzles that test your reflexes and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 4 stages are designed for beginners, allowing players to get used to the game mechanics without much difficulty. You\u2019ll breeze through these stages quickly \u2014 but don\u2019t get too comfortable, as the real challenge begins afterwards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Stage 5 onwards, you\u2019ll encounter a series of intricate and punishing traps. Surviving these and reaching the escape warp will require sharp focus and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages 6 and 7 will push your physical abilities even further. If you have confidence in your gaming skills, you should be able to navigate through these tough trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there\u2019s the final Stage 8: the ultimate challenge. Even the developers have yet to beat it flawlessly. This stage is packed with unexpected traps and relentless obstacles, making it the true test of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t be discouraged \u2014 it is absolutely possible to beat the game. If you can conquer this final stage and see the ending, you\u2019ll earn the title of King of Physical Skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Prove it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to The Madness Trap Trek, a game with 8 progressively challenging stages filled with traps and puzzles that test your reflexes and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 4 stages are designed for beginners, allowing players to get used to the game mechanics without much difficulty. You\u2019ll breeze through these stages quickly \u2014 but don\u2019t get too comfortable, as the real challenge begins afterwards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Stage 5 onwards, you\u2019ll encounter a series of intricate and punishing traps. Surviving these and reaching the escape warp will require sharp focus and quick reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stages 6 and 7 will push your physical abilities even further. If you have confidence in your gaming skills, you should be able to navigate through these tough trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then there\u2019s the final Stage 8: the ultimate challenge. Even the developers have yet to beat it flawlessly. This stage is packed with unexpected traps and relentless obstacles, making it the true test of your abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t be discouraged \u2014 it is absolutely possible to beat the game. If you can conquer this final stage and see the ending, you\u2019ll earn the title of King of Physical Skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you\u2019ve got what it takes? Prove it!</p>",
    "short_description": "The Madness Trap Trek is a thrilling escape adventure where you must dodge deadly traps and make it out of the dungeon alive. Each stage challenges you with a unique path to freedom, filled with hidden dangers that will test your reflexes and strategy.",
